# Build outputs / staging
/stage/
sysroot/
*.tar.gz
*.o
*.so
*.a
# MIG / generated stubs.
#
# Every generated stub is written into one of these two directories, so the
# directories are what we ignore. Do NOT add bare patterns like *User.c or
# *Server.c: core.ignorecase is true on a case-insensitive filesystem, so
# they also match ordinary sources such as adduser.c, bootstrap_server.c and
# migcom.tproj/user.c, and a new file of that name is then silently left out
# of the repository with no error from git add. That has happened twice.
.mig/
*-mig/
# CI scratch
artifacts/
out/
tests/boot.log
tests/boot.exp
tests/disk.img
